      "width": 230,
      "height": 82.5,
      "text": "1. parse JWT (RS256)\n2. issuer == OIDC_ISSUER\n3. JWKS sig + exp (+ aud)\n4. role: /mcp->read, write->mcp:write\n200 ok / 401 (WWW-Authenticate)\n/ 403 missing_role",
